<![CDATA[<span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#009900" size="2"><b>Attention:&nbsp;</b></font></span><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">This is to notify you of an ATG Opportunity that is now&nbsp;<b>Done&nbsp;</b>and&nbsp;<b>Closed&nbsp;</b>in SFDC.&nbsp;</span><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px;"><font style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12px;"><br></span></font><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000066" size="2"><b><u>Case Study Reminder:</u></b></font><span style="font-size: 12px;">&nbsp;Please fill out the case study form found&nbsp;</span><a href="https://atg123.sharepoint.com/marketing/_layouts/15/WopiFrame.aspx?sourcedoc={677F546E-F776-4541-9BDB-7FB34DA9639E}&amp;file=ATG%20Case%20Study%20-%20Template.docx&amp;action=default" style="font-size: 12px;">here</a><span style="font-size: 12px;">.</span></span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000066">Account Name:</font></span><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;{!Opportunity.Account}&nbsp;</span><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000066">Opportunity Name:</font></span><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</span><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12px;">{!Opportunity.Name}</span></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000066">Opportunity URL:</font></span><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;{!Opportunity.Link}&nbsp;</span><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000066">Opportunity Owner:</font></span><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;{!Opportunity.OwnerFullName}&nbsp;</span><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000066">Opportunity Stage:</font></span><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;{!Opportunity.StageName}&nbsp;</span><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000066">Opportunity Amount:</font></span><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif